TRADING DISCLAIMER: this software places real orders with real money. The
parameters encoded here are reverse-engineered from another account's public
trade history and are not investment advice. The strategy's own measured edge
is $4.33/round with a standard error of $2.24 (t = 1.94) over 633 rounds —
statistically weak. Fees can exceed the entire gross edge. Read README.md
before running with LIVE=1.
